# Deny by default; only source Python and the two build inputs may enter context.
**
!Dockerfile
!requirements-hosted.txt
!src/
!src/**/
!src/**/*.py

# Explicit privacy exclusions remain last, even under allowed source directories.
**/.git
**/.env*
**/data
**/backups
**/logs
**/runtime
**/staging-data
**/tests
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-journal
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.pdf
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.webp
**/*.md
